    `median ${pct(middle(field("trade_return")))} · mean worst close ${pct(mean(field("worst")))} · mean best close ${pct(mean(field("best")))} · ` +
    `median ${num(middle(field("sessions_to_low")))} sessions to the low` : "No episodes in this sample";
  table("entries-table", ["First signal","Last signal","Signal days","Since previous start","After first VIX ≥24","VIX at signal","QQQ vs 252-day high",
    "Entry","Entry price","Exit","Exit price","VIX at exit","Return","Worst","Best","Sessions to low","Sessions to recover","Mean of all signal days"],
    rows.map(row => [row.signal_date,row.last_signal_date,num(row.signal_days),num(row.sessions_since_previous_start),num(row.sessions_after_first_vix_24),
